WEBVTT

00:10:59.716 --> 00:11:02.196
the key factor
in that success is the people.

00:11:02.196 --> 00:11:06.916
And having worked in innovation
almost all my adult life,

00:11:06.956 --> 00:11:12.396
I can honestly say that the people
I work with every day are,

00:11:12.396 --> 00:11:14.756
you are, the solution.

00:11:15.436 --> 00:11:17.516
We are different this time.

00:11:17.556 --> 00:11:19.836
And that’s why it’s different this time.

00:11:19.876 --> 00:11:21.756
And we will succeed.

00:11:21.796 --> 00:11:22.796
Thank you.

00:11:22.836 --> 00:11:26.396
(Applause)